1
00:00:09,777 --> 00:00:12,045
[Ready or not,]

2
00:00:12,479 --> 00:00:14,448
[here I come.]

3
00:00:16,416 --> 00:00:21,121
[SUMBAKKOKJIL]
[Anyone who wants to play hide-and-seek, gather around here.]

4
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:26,260
[The sunsets beyond the mountains.]

5
00:00:27,561 --> 00:00:29,897
[Finally arrived at a remote retreat center]

6
00:00:30,664 --> 00:00:33,033
[after hours of driving in the dark.]

7
00:00:36,303 --> 00:00:39,540
[An unexplainable, eerie energy fills this place.]

8
00:00:45,446 --> 00:00:46,446
SHOTARO!

9
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:47,780
Hey, SOHEE!

10
00:00:48,515 --> 00:00:49,515
Hey guys! Where are you?!

11
00:00:49,783 --> 00:00:51,785
[The 6 members of RIIZE are left in this place.]

12
00:00:51,852 --> 00:00:52,852
Where are you, RIIZE?

13
00:00:55,289 --> 00:00:56,690
I'm just going to hide.

14
00:00:57,157 --> 00:00:59,626
I can’t do this. I’m too scared.

15
00:01:00,961 --> 00:01:02,529
Wait. Hold on. Where am I?

16
00:01:02,729 --> 00:01:04,097
Pause. Pause.

17
00:01:06,166 --> 00:01:08,535
This is really scary.

18
00:01:08,669 --> 00:01:09,669
Ha...

19
00:01:10,504 --> 00:01:12,172
What the…

20
00:01:12,606 --> 00:01:14,674
I guess it's starting now.

21
00:01:15,209 --> 00:01:17,611
Woah, hold on.

22
00:01:17,978 --> 00:01:20,114
I have a bad feeling about this.

23
00:01:20,714 --> 00:01:24,451
[The moment of confronting an unknown being.]

24
00:01:30,991 --> 00:01:37,431
[You can never escape.]

25
00:01:45,339 --> 00:01:50,110
[SUMBAKKOKJIL]

26
00:01:54,748 --> 00:01:55,748
Oh, no.

27
00:01:56,149 --> 00:01:57,784
I’m screwed.

28
00:02:00,054 --> 00:02:01,154
Woah, hold on.

29
00:02:02,256 --> 00:02:04,191
Where is this place?

30
00:02:08,328 --> 00:02:09,462
What is this?

31
00:02:11,699 --> 00:02:17,671
[Each member of RIIZE opens their eyes in a different place.]

32
00:02:19,473 --> 00:02:20,740
Where am I?

33
00:02:21,808 --> 00:02:24,010
[What they see before them is completely different.]

34
00:02:24,545 --> 00:02:25,545
Ah...

35
00:02:25,546 --> 00:02:27,948
Why am I in here?

36
00:02:34,688 --> 00:02:36,156
What the...?

37
00:02:36,623 --> 00:02:37,991
What is this place?

38
00:02:39,126 --> 00:02:41,729
Hold on. Did the game start?

39
00:02:43,163 --> 00:02:46,166
Can I move around?

40
00:02:46,700 --> 00:02:48,535
Hold on. Wait a minute.

41
00:02:48,969 --> 00:02:50,270
What should I do?

42
00:02:50,804 --> 00:02:52,272
[SUNGCHAN is located on B1.]

43
00:02:53,073 --> 00:02:54,273
[ANTON is located on 1F.]
[SHOTARO is located on 2F.]

44
00:02:55,475 --> 00:02:57,377
[SOHEE and EUNSEOK are located on the 3rd floor.]
[WONBIN is located on the 4th floor.]

45
00:02:58,645 --> 00:02:59,780
[Phone alarm goes off]

46
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,248
Wait, hold on.

47
00:03:01,882 --> 00:03:04,851
Be quiet, be quiet, be quiet, be quiet.

48
00:03:11,091 --> 00:03:13,927
[From this moment on,
find the keys that only the brave can obtain]

49
00:03:14,528 --> 00:03:18,032
[If you are captured by the seeker,
you can use the keys to escape.
(However, one key per person to escape.)]

50
00:03:18,598 --> 00:03:20,100
SAVE ME

51
00:03:21,702 --> 00:03:22,102
Keys?

52
00:03:22,269 --> 00:03:24,371
Find the keys?

53
00:03:26,206 --> 00:03:29,776
[The members started to move after checking the message.]

54
00:03:30,243 --> 00:03:32,712
[SOHEE is located on the 3rd floor.]

55
00:03:36,216 --> 00:03:37,951
[Sound of the phone dropping.]

56
00:03:44,157 --> 00:03:49,662
[EUNSEOK and SOHEE are located on the 3rd floor.]

57
00:03:50,197 --> 00:03:52,265
[EUNSEOK sighing]

58
00:03:52,733 --> 00:03:55,168
Hide-and-seek really is...

59
00:03:55,469 --> 00:03:57,204
scary just thinking that

60
00:03:57,204 --> 00:03:58,839
someone is out there trying to catch me.

61
00:04:05,212 --> 00:04:06,813
This is the food storage room.

62
00:04:10,751 --> 00:04:14,821
[SUNGCHAN is located on the 1st floor.]

63
00:04:15,656 --> 00:04:17,257
Where should I hide?

64
00:04:19,993 --> 00:04:22,662
My main goal is

65
00:04:22,963 --> 00:04:25,132
hiding. Hiding from the seeker.

66
00:04:27,501 --> 00:04:30,404
Why is this scary for no good reason?

67
00:04:35,342 --> 00:04:36,910
Should I hide here?

68
00:04:42,583 --> 00:04:44,185
I think this is a good spot.

69
00:04:47,621 --> 00:04:49,056
This spot

70
00:04:50,223 --> 00:04:53,159
has a lot of desks and chairs

71
00:04:53,593 --> 00:04:55,361
and I’m sitting on the corner of it.

72
00:04:56,330 --> 00:04:58,331
This is terrifying.

73
00:04:59,366 --> 00:05:02,836
[SUNGCHAN →]

74
00:05:03,504 --> 00:05:07,307
There is…

75
00:05:07,407 --> 00:05:09,976
no point of finding the keys

76
00:05:10,544 --> 00:05:11,945
because

77
00:05:12,479 --> 00:05:14,915
I just don’t need to get caught.

78
00:05:15,415 --> 00:05:16,783
The keys...

79
00:05:17,351 --> 00:05:19,186
are not my business, sorry.

80
00:05:19,953 --> 00:05:21,488
[SUNGCHAN laughing]

81
00:05:24,191 --> 00:05:26,693
[ANTON is located on the 1st floor.]
[At the same time on the 1st floor.]

82
00:05:28,328 --> 00:05:29,928
Because I am a coward…

83
00:05:30,330 --> 00:05:32,332
Do I have to start hiding?

84
00:05:32,866 --> 00:05:34,868
[ANTON has similar thoughts to SUNGCHAN]

85
00:05:35,636 --> 00:05:37,838
I’m just going to hide.

86
00:05:39,039 --> 00:05:40,039
I can’t do it.

87
00:05:40,807 --> 00:05:41,907
It’s too scary.

88
00:05:44,945 --> 00:05:45,945
Oh no...

89
00:05:50,250 --> 00:05:52,552
[ANTON →]

90
00:05:53,153 --> 00:05:56,023
(Hiding) This may be my best choice…

91
00:05:56,823 --> 00:05:58,559
This may be my best at trying.

92
00:06:01,295 --> 00:06:04,098
I’ll try to stay put here.

93
00:06:04,564 --> 00:06:09,570
If not, then, I hope someone comes to tell me?

94
00:06:10,671 --> 00:06:14,241
But really, if the seeker comes and finds me here,

95
00:06:14,308 --> 00:06:17,911
I think I'll be really scared.

96
00:06:19,112 --> 00:06:20,412
Can I move this?

97
00:06:22,182 --> 00:06:23,382
I mean…

98
00:06:23,683 --> 00:06:25,652
I can't move right now, right?

99
00:06:34,795 --> 00:06:36,463
Can I come out now?

100
00:06:42,035 --> 00:06:45,405
[Scanning the surroundings.]

101
00:06:45,772 --> 00:06:47,707
[Slowly makes his way out of the elevator.]

102
00:06:50,811 --> 00:06:52,413
Can I come out and move around?

103
00:06:55,148 --> 00:06:57,384
Do I have to hide right away?

104
00:06:59,152 --> 00:07:01,221
[WONBIN sighing]

105
00:07:02,689 --> 00:07:05,392
I'm not really good at these.

106
00:07:06,226 --> 00:07:09,663
[While most of the members are confused.]

107
00:07:11,064 --> 00:07:15,135
[EUNSEOK is located on the 3rd floor.]

108
00:07:15,702 --> 00:07:17,837
[EUNSEOK is looking for the keys.]

109
00:07:19,406 --> 00:07:20,440
There’s nothing here.

110
00:07:20,807 --> 00:07:21,847
Forget about the hiding,

111
00:07:22,509 --> 00:07:25,278
I have no clue where the keys are.

112
00:07:26,213 --> 00:07:27,881
There’s absolutely nothing here.

113
00:07:31,218 --> 00:07:33,086
Ha… This is really.

114
00:07:34,821 --> 00:07:37,290
Ha... This is quite frustrating.

115
00:07:37,691 --> 00:07:40,160
The thought of someone trying to catch me

116
00:07:40,227 --> 00:07:42,462
makes me really careful whenever I move.

117
00:07:43,797 --> 00:07:46,133
I get sensitive to every sound

118
00:07:46,633 --> 00:07:48,935
and even now I can hear footsteps

119
00:07:51,605 --> 00:07:53,106
and doors opening…

120
00:07:53,473 --> 00:07:56,743
I’m getting confused if it’s my members making the sound or if it’s the seeker,

121
00:07:57,077 --> 00:07:58,812
so I have to be careful when I move.

122
00:07:59,746 --> 00:08:02,279
[SOHEE is located on the 4th floor.]
[On the other hand, SOHEE is confidently(?) moving around.]

123
00:08:02,282 --> 00:08:04,517
Can I enter these places too?

124
00:08:08,555 --> 00:08:09,555
The keys aren't in here.

125
00:08:11,391 --> 00:08:13,760
(Right now) Time to look for the keys.

126
00:08:16,229 --> 00:08:20,266
[Sound of the door opening and closing.]

127
00:08:23,170 --> 00:08:24,570
Ahh, hold on.

128
00:08:27,507 --> 00:08:29,175
[A blanket spread out on the floor of the room.]

129
00:08:30,043 --> 00:08:32,612
(Doubting his eyes.)

130
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,682
Ahh, hold on.

131
00:08:36,650 --> 00:08:40,253
[There’s someone underneath the blanket?]

132
00:08:43,089 --> 00:08:44,356
Don’t prank me like this!

133
00:08:54,367 --> 00:08:56,003
[SOHEE lifts up the blanket.]

134
00:08:57,737 --> 00:08:59,038
Yikes!

135
00:08:59,339 --> 00:09:00,339
Wow.

136
00:09:04,244 --> 00:09:08,582
[Finds the key placed next to the hand.]

137
00:09:15,689 --> 00:09:17,924
Look! It’s the key! key! key! key!

138
00:09:18,358 --> 00:09:19,826
I found a key.

139
00:09:22,929 --> 00:09:26,633
[Starts looking for another key right after.]

140
00:09:30,070 --> 00:09:31,672
Oh? Hey!

141
00:09:31,905 --> 00:09:33,707
Hey!

142
00:09:34,608 --> 00:09:36,128
[ SOHEE runs into WONBIN
who was coming down the stairs.]

143
00:09:36,310 --> 00:09:37,310
Where were you?

144
00:09:37,677 --> 00:09:38,477
In the elevator.

145
00:09:38,578 --> 00:09:40,914
I was stuck in the elevator!

146
00:09:42,282 --> 00:09:43,282
Hey, you wanna stay together?

147
00:09:43,316 --> 00:09:43,816
No,no

148
00:09:43,850 --> 00:09:44,450
Just this once.

149
00:09:44,551 --> 00:09:45,719
No,no,no,no

150
00:09:46,286 --> 00:09:46,586
Just this time!

151
00:09:46,953 --> 00:09:47,953
Let’s go together, just this once.

152
00:09:48,188 --> 00:09:50,223
No, we’re screwed if we get caught by the seeker.

153
00:09:50,223 --> 00:09:52,625
Please, just this once...

154
00:09:52,959 --> 00:09:56,196
The sound of that smoke makes it more scary.

155
00:09:56,496 --> 00:09:58,031
Right?

156
00:09:59,566 --> 00:10:02,769
[Smoke sound effect]

157
00:10:05,605 --> 00:10:07,641
[Both get scared by the loud sound.]

158
00:10:11,812 --> 00:10:13,213
Is it the smoke sound?

159
00:10:18,184 --> 00:10:20,687
[Eventually, they move to the 2nd floor together.]

160
00:10:21,821 --> 00:10:24,490
[SHOTARO is in the 2nd floor storage room.]

161
00:10:25,525 --> 00:10:29,729
I can’t call the members with this, right?

162
00:10:30,363 --> 00:10:31,430
I don’t have their

163
00:10:32,031 --> 00:10:33,031
contacts.

164
00:10:33,700 --> 00:10:36,369
Should I go look for the key?

165
00:10:36,402 --> 00:10:38,638
But where is it?

166
00:10:39,472 --> 00:10:41,040
What is this?

167
00:10:42,509 --> 00:10:44,511
I don’t know for sure what this is

168
00:10:45,211 --> 00:10:46,679
but there’s a box.

169
00:10:47,247 --> 00:10:49,516
[Opening the box.]

170
00:10:49,782 --> 00:10:50,782
What’s this?

171
00:10:52,352 --> 00:10:54,221
What is this?

172
00:10:54,721 --> 00:10:55,954
Isn't it a letter? A letter.

173
00:10:56,823 --> 00:10:59,826
[An unidentifiable white sheet of paper →]

174
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:01,780
[Sound of someone outside the door.]

175
00:11:07,634 --> 00:11:08,834
Hold on, hold on, hold on, hold on.

176
00:11:09,502 --> 00:11:11,104
I heard a noise!

177
00:11:11,805 --> 00:11:13,273
I have to stay quiet.

178
00:11:14,707 --> 00:11:16,842
[Hurries and hides himself in the corner of the room.]

179
00:11:19,479 --> 00:11:21,981
[At that moment, the door opens.]

180
00:11:22,649 --> 00:11:24,717
I think it’s gonna be in here (the key).

181
00:11:25,685 --> 00:11:31,291
[SOHEE and WONBIN enter the storage room.]

182
00:11:32,459 --> 00:11:33,159
Hey!

183
00:11:33,159 --> 00:11:33,893
AH! You scared me!

184
00:11:33,927 --> 00:11:35,260
What is it?! What is it!? What is it!?

185
00:11:35,695 --> 00:11:36,696
You scared me!

186
00:11:37,564 --> 00:11:41,301
[← SHOTARO]

187
00:11:41,935 --> 00:11:47,140
[An unexpected get-together.]

188
00:11:49,910 --> 00:11:53,113
You scared me! I thought you were the seeker.

189
00:11:55,015 --> 00:11:56,115
Hey, I missed you!

190
00:11:57,417 --> 00:11:58,417
Where were you hiding?

191
00:11:59,919 --> 00:12:01,199
But, where did you meet SOHEE ?

192
00:12:01,788 --> 00:12:02,754
The stairs!

193
00:12:02,822 --> 00:12:03,922
Ah-ha, the stairs.

194
00:12:05,225 --> 00:12:07,927
[SOHEE heading to the stairs again.]

195
00:12:08,795 --> 00:12:09,948
Should we open the elevator?

196
00:12:11,564 --> 00:12:14,534
I opened the elevator door and the key was right there.

197
00:12:14,767 --> 00:12:16,002
Ah, really?

198
00:12:16,937 --> 00:12:19,873
[A mysterious object encountered right after opening the eyes.]

199
00:12:20,940 --> 00:12:22,475
This is really scary.

200
00:12:23,376 --> 00:12:24,916
[Carefully lifting up the black cloth.]

201
00:12:27,781 --> 00:12:28,781
Uh, what is this?

202
00:12:29,983 --> 00:12:32,819
[Obtained the key beneath the black cloth.]

203
00:12:34,187 --> 00:12:35,787
[WONBIN and SHOTARO are located on the 2nd floor.]

204
00:12:35,855 --> 00:12:38,491
I’m extremely happy seeing you.

205
00:12:38,558 --> 00:12:39,731
But you’re not the seeker, right?

206
00:12:39,993 --> 00:12:40,993
No, I’m not.

207
00:12:42,062 --> 00:12:44,597
I think the keys are hiding somewhere here.

208
00:12:45,698 --> 00:12:46,698
Wait...

209
00:12:49,169 --> 00:12:51,404
There’s nowhere to hide here.

210
00:12:52,505 --> 00:12:55,608
I hope they don’t ask us to dance to ‘Siren’ as part of a mission later.

211
00:12:58,211 --> 00:12:59,779
Ah… should I just get caught by the seeker?

212
00:13:00,213 --> 00:13:01,213
No!

213
00:13:02,282 --> 00:13:03,282
How about here?

214
00:13:03,383 --> 00:13:04,650
Can we go in?

215
00:13:09,389 --> 00:13:11,157
[Sound of someone coming from far away.]

216
00:13:14,093 --> 00:13:16,996
[WONBIN hiding in one corner.]

217
00:13:20,300 --> 00:13:22,336
[SHOTARO hiding on the stairs.]

218
00:13:34,281 --> 00:13:37,517
[Checking to see where the sound came from.]

219
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:41,400
[← Someone approaching from far ahead.]

220
00:13:41,454 --> 00:13:42,254
Who is it?

221
00:13:42,388 --> 00:13:43,388
It’s me, WONBIN.

222
00:13:43,923 --> 00:13:45,324
[The source of the sound was SOHEE.]
I think

223
00:13:47,293 --> 00:13:48,633
right now isn’t the time to hide.

224
00:13:48,695 --> 00:13:49,295
Really?

225
00:13:49,362 --> 00:13:50,062
We are supposed to look for the keys right now.

226
00:13:50,129 --> 00:13:51,797
Ah, we have to look for the keys?

227
00:13:52,265 --> 00:13:53,465
Oh, then I’m going to walk freely as well.

228
00:13:53,866 --> 00:13:54,766
I was scared for nothing.

229
00:13:54,801 --> 00:13:56,269
Can we open anywhere we like?

230
00:13:59,739 --> 00:14:00,739
[SHOTARO is located on the 1st floor. ]

231
00:14:01,074 --> 00:14:02,842
[Unexpectedly, SHOTARO got separated from WONBIN.]

232
00:14:03,877 --> 00:14:06,145
[Enters a random room on the 1st floor.]

233
00:14:07,580 --> 00:14:09,382
WONBIN...

234
00:14:09,849 --> 00:14:11,651
Where did WONBIN go?

235
00:14:14,354 --> 00:14:16,322
Uh... I guess someone was here?

236
00:14:16,789 --> 00:14:18,257
There’s a sleep mask.

237
00:14:23,096 --> 00:14:24,116
[Actually, this place is where ANTON is hiding.]

238
00:14:24,197 --> 00:14:27,467
[ANTON →]

239
00:14:32,138 --> 00:14:36,175
[Without knowing the truth,
SHOTARO eagerly searches for the keys.]

240
00:14:40,313 --> 00:14:41,313
What is that?

241
00:14:43,116 --> 00:14:45,385
[SHOTARO and ANTON laughing.]

242
00:14:51,424 --> 00:14:53,426
Did you hear me coming?

243
00:14:53,793 --> 00:14:55,261
Just now.

244
00:14:55,361 --> 00:14:56,896
I was here the whole time.

245
00:14:58,464 --> 00:14:59,866
You scared me!

246
00:15:00,299 --> 00:15:01,199
SHOTARO,

247
00:15:01,234 --> 00:15:02,736
can you cover the top with this?

248
00:15:02,969 --> 00:15:03,969
What?

249
00:15:04,604 --> 00:15:05,604
You want me to cover you up?

250
00:15:05,672 --> 00:15:06,672
Yea...

251
00:15:10,610 --> 00:15:12,478
When did you come?

252
00:15:12,845 --> 00:15:15,248
I was here this whole time from the beginning.

253
00:15:17,683 --> 00:15:19,451
Why here? You scared me!

254
00:15:20,253 --> 00:15:22,488
I had no clue someone was going to be in here...

255
00:15:23,823 --> 00:15:25,091
[Phone alarm goes off.]

256
00:15:30,696 --> 00:15:34,767
[Hint for the key.]
[Food storage room on B1.]

257
00:15:35,268 --> 00:15:36,268
It’s in the basement.

258
00:15:36,736 --> 00:15:37,736
This is the 1st floor, right?

259
00:15:38,204 --> 00:15:39,605
But...

260
00:15:40,072 --> 00:15:42,041
if you have the courage, then you should go.

261
00:15:42,375 --> 00:15:44,377
If you don't, then just stay here

262
00:15:45,144 --> 00:15:46,479
like me.

263
00:15:47,413 --> 00:15:49,649
SHOTARO!

264
00:15:49,982 --> 00:15:51,102
Before you leave, can you cover this up?

265
00:15:52,852 --> 00:15:54,787
Ah, what are you doing?!

266
00:15:55,288 --> 00:15:57,190
Cover it up properly!

267
00:15:57,623 --> 00:15:58,743
Is this an easy hiding spot?

268
00:15:58,891 --> 00:15:59,691
No.

269
00:16:00,359 --> 00:16:02,361
